title "MON - LITTLE SEOUL"
text "The game in slot {s}, live: its variables, its memory (B back, R again: fresh)."
tool home "Home"
tool player "Player"
tool round "Round"
tool talk "Talk"
tool frame "Frame"
tool program "Program"
tool pages "Pages"
tool console "Console"

cat "LITTLE SEOUL"

